{"title":"Transportation and Logistics Systems Lab","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Transportation and Logistics Systems Lab","page-layout":"article","toc":false,"listing":{"id":"home-news","contents":"news","sort":"date desc","type":"table","fields":["date","title"],"field-display-names":{"date":"","title":""},"max-items":3,"categories":false,"date-format":"MMMM YYYY","sort-ui":false,"filter-ui":false}},"headingText":"Usman Ahmed","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.hero}\n::: {.hero-text}\n<div class=\"hero-eyebrow\">Transportation Research</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"hero-role\">Research Assistant Professor</div>\n<div class=\"hero-affiliation\">UT-Oak Ridge Innovation Institute, University of Tennessee, Knoxville</div>\n\n<div class=\"hero-interests\">\nI study traffic operations, transportation safety, and the integration of connected and\nautomated vehicles into everyday mobility — using data and modeling to make transportation\nsystems safer, more efficient, and more equitable.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hero-actions\">\n<a class=\"btn-line btn-solid\" href=\"files/Usman_Ahmed_CV.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download CV</a>\n<a class=\"btn-line btn-outline\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com\" target=\"_blank\">Google Scholar</a>\n</div>\n:::\n\n<div class=\"hero-figure\">\nPortrait placeholder<br>(images/profile.jpg)\n</div>\n:::\n\n<hr class=\"rule\">\n\n::: {.page-section}\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">Research Areas</div>\n</div>\n\n::: {.plain-grid}\n<div>\n### Traffic Flow & Control\nModeling and controlling traffic dynamics on freeways and arterials, including signal\ntiming and mixed human/automated traffic.\n</div>\n<div>\n### Transportation Safety\nStatistical and machine-learning methods for crash prediction and proactive safety\nmanagement.\n</div>\n<div>\n### Connected & Automated Vehicles\nEvaluating how CV/AV technologies affect network performance and safety during the\ntransition period.\n</div>\n<div>\n### Transit Equity\nMeasuring and improving access to public transit for underserved populations.\n</div>\n:::\n\n[View all research areas &rarr;](research.qmd)\n:::\n\n<hr class=\"rule\">\n\n::: {.page-section}\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">Featured Projects</div>\n<a class=\"view-all\" href=\"projects.qmd\">All projects &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n\n{{< include _includes/featured-projects.qmd >}}\n:::\n\n<hr class=\"rule\">\n\n::: {.page-section}\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">Recent Publications</div>\n<a class=\"view-all\" href=\"publications.qmd\">All publications &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n\n{{< include _includes/recent-publications.qmd >}}\n:::\n\n<hr class=\"rule\">\n\n::: {.page-section}\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">Latest News</div>\n<a class=\"view-all\" href=\"news.qmd\">All news &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n\n::: {#home-news}\n:::\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.hero}\n::: {.hero-text}\n<div class=\"hero-eyebrow\">Transportation Research</div>\n\n# Usman Ahmed\n\n<div class=\"hero-role\">Research Assistant Professor</div>\n<div class=\"hero-affiliation\">UT-Oak Ridge Innovation Institute, University of Tennessee, Knoxville</div>\n\n<div class=\"hero-interests\">\nI study traffic operations, transportation safety, and the integration of connected and\nautomated vehicles into everyday mobility — using data and modeling to make transportation\nsystems safer, more efficient, and more equitable.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hero-actions\">\n<a class=\"btn-line btn-solid\" href=\"files/Usman_Ahmed_CV.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Download CV</a>\n<a class=\"btn-line btn-outline\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com\" target=\"_blank\">Google Scholar</a>\n</div>\n:::\n\n<div class=\"hero-figure\">\nPortrait placeholder<br>(images/profile.jpg)\n</div>\n:::\n\n<hr class=\"rule\">\n\n::: {.page-section}\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div class=\"section-label\">Research Areas</div>\n</div>\n\n::: {.plain-grid}\n<div>\n#